summary.label:
Thanks to AI Teleprompter you will be able to perform your speeches without any issues!

Main features:
- Two scrolling modes: Timed or by Voice (with audio calibration and background noise suppression);
- Custom Speed setting;
- Import scripts from your device, from iCloud or by pasting them into the app;
- Smart Gestures: Tilt your head to scroll, smile to pause/play;
- Bluetooth Remote: Use another device as a remote to scroll, play and pause;
- Customize the Teleprompter text and background;
- Record videos while scrolling the script;
- Mirror mode.
